($q$legal.terms.paid_plans_are_monthly_at$q$,$q$default$q$,$q$always$q$,$q$Paid plans are Monthly at $49 or Annual at $352.80. A subscription renews automatically until you cancel. You can cancel any time from Settings &gt; Billing. After you cancel, access continues until the end of the paid period. We don't refund partial periods. If a payment fails, you keep paid access for 24 hours. After that, the account moves to the free plan until the card succeeds. Stripe processes payments.$q$,'en',$q$terms page text.$q$,$q$live$q$),
