($q$legal.terms.watchlists_hold_up_to_100$q$,$q$default$q$,$q$always$q$,$q$Watchlists hold up to 100 funds. Alerts are sent on a best-effort basis and may be delayed or miss events.$q$,'en',$q$terms page text.$q$,$q$live$q$),
($q$legal.terms.fund_reports_are_compiled_from$q$,$q$default$q$,$q$always$q$,$q$Fund reports are compiled from public sources, including court records, SEC and other regulatory filings, and press coverage. Each scored fact links to its source.$q$,'en',$q$terms page text.$q$,$q$live$q$),
