($q$legal.terms.funds_people_named_in_reports$q$,$q$default$q$,$q$always$q$,$q$Funds, people named in reports, and anyone else can request a correction, free of charge. Send the page, what's wrong, and a source. We review every request and update or annotate the report where warranted.$q$,'en',$q$terms page text.$q$,$q$live$q$),
($q$legal.terms.only_review_a_fund_you$q$,$q$default$q$,$q$always$q$,$q$Only review a fund you took money from, or were in a funded round with, as a founder or executive.$q$,'en',$q$terms page text.$q$,$q$live$q$),
